ki-toc-h2" href="#zh-quick-routes">常用目的地怎么找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-present-uptown">现代 — 上城区</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-present-downtown">现代 — 市中心</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-medieval-village">中世纪 — 村庄郊外</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-medieval-demesne">中世纪 — 国王领地</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-future-fringe">未来 — 边缘区</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-future-prime">未来 — 核心区</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-rose-thorn">玫瑰与荆棘的室内区域</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-vampire-lair">吸血鬼区域</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-haunted-mansion">闹鬼豪宅</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-christmas-village">圣诞村</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-sirena-isle">塞壬岛</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-resistance-fortress">反抗军基地与塔防设施</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-syndicate">辛迪加场所</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-deep-woods">深林步行区域</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-optional-wildheart">可选世界：Wildheart：野林</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">地点没有出现或不能进入</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><div class="starter-lead"><p>Check the menu’s current Objectives first, then choose the era and district. A map building can contain several indoor rooms. Some entrances come from indoor actions, invitations, construction or event Objectives. Expand the indexes when you are ready to see later location names.</p><ol><li>Open the current era’s district map and check the destination and opening hours.</li><li>Inside a building, inspect its travel and return actions.</li><li>If a destination is missing, check Objectives, hours and the room containing its entrance.</li></ol></div>
<section id="en-travel"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Three_Eras"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Travel_&amp;_Access_Rules"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Travel_.26_Access_Rules"></span><h2>Maps, the clock and era travel</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Era</th><th scope="col">Usual anchor</th><th scope="col">Districts</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Present</th><td data-label="Usual anchor">Your Bedroom (appearance follows starting proficiency)</td><td data-label="Districts">Uptown / Downtown</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval</th><td data-label="Usual anchor">Ancient Earth Shrine (Altar Chamber)</td><td data-label="Districts">Village Outskirts / Kings Demesne</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future</th><td data-label="Usual anchor">Nova's Quantum Research Lab</td><td data-label="Districts">Fringe Zone / Prime Sector</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>Era jumps normally have a 60-minute base cost; related upgrades change the current duration. Follow the entry and current upgrades.</li><li>Ordinary map movement within one district normally does not advance the clock. District changes and indoor actions use their own times. Present-era transit has its own tickets and pass upgrades.</li><li>Both Future transport hubs sell Hyperloop Coordinates:300 credits and 10 minutes, once. They unlock the map’s district switch and make transit follow the selected destination.</li><li>Closing times are exclusive: a 09:00–17:00 location closes at 17:00. Teacher schedules and lesson hours are additional conditions; scheduled events follow their own notice.</li><li>A dash means no fixed location opening hours, rather than guaranteeing every character or action is available all day.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-quick-routes"><h2>Useful routes to remember</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Task</th><th scope="col">Route</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Recovery and everyday learning</th><td data-label="Route">Your Bedroom (appearance follows starting proficiency)；City Gym (Uptown)；City Library (Uptown)；University Campus</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mining</th><td data-label="Route">Mountain Foothills → <a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">Mining guide</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dungeon exploration</th><td data-label="Route"><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon entrances, preparation and return</a>；<a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">Infinity Dungeon</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Guilds</th><td data-label="Route">Fighters Guild；Bards Guild；Back Alleys → Thieves Guild</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">TD base</th><td data-label="Route">Resistance Hideout → Operations Center → <a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shop expansion</th><td data-label="Route">Corner Convenience Store → expanded shop and storage room after its commission</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
