<section id="en-deep-woods"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Deep_Woods"></span><h2>Walking the Deep Woods</h2><p>Royal Hunting Grounds (Edge) → Forest Clearing → Enter Deep Woods (10 min). This guide’s coordinates identify 100 walkable areas: the top-left entrance is(0,0), east increases the first coordinate and south the second. A step normally takes 10 minutes. Edges wrap: moving east from column 9 returns to column 0. Leave from(0,0) to return to the Forest Clearing.</p><details><summary>Show the 10×10 landmark index</summary><p>A dot is an ordinary Deep Woods area. Columns are the first coordinate; rows are the second.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">y / x</th><th scope="col">0</th><th scope="col">1</th><th scope="col">2</th><th scope="col">3</th><th scope="col">4</th><th scope="col">5</th><th scope="col">6</th><th scope="col">7</th><th scope="col">8</th><th scope="col">9</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">0</th><td data-label="0">Deep Woods (Entrance)</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">Mushroom Circle</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">Magical Springs</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">The Forest Cave</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">The Ancient Tree</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">Predator's Den</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">The Quiet Meadow</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">The Bog</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">Huntress Lair</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">Altar Stone</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">Abandoned Camp</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">Ancient Ruins</td><td data-label="5">·</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">Canopy Overlook</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="0">·</td><td data-label="1">·</td><td data-label="2">·</td><td data-label="3">·</td><td data-label="4">·</td><td data-label="5">Poacher's Cache</td><td data-label="6">·</td><td data-label="7">·</td><td data-label="8">·</td><td data-label="9">·</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-optional-wildheart"><h2>Optional world: Wildheart: Wild Woods</h2><p>This separately installed world is outside the base-world map. Its absence from a base-only installation is expected.</p><ol><li>Obtain the optional-world package and follow its instructions to extract it under the game’s game/mods/ folder.</li><li>Open Mod Manager from the main menu, enable Wildheart: Wild Woods and restart. Changing its enabled state does not load an entire world immediately.</li><li>Use the normal redemption entry for the access code supplied with the content. This index does not list code values.</li><li>In Medieval: Forest Clearing → Deep Woods, reach this guide’s(3,2), then choose Enter Wild Woods. The world must be enabled and its access redeemed.</li><li>Use the world’s own map after entering. Return to Deep Woods at the Gateway to leave. Crossing worlds normally uses the era-jump duration; check the current cost.</li></ol><details><summary>Show optional-world destinations (separate from the base index)</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">Approach</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Wild Woods Gateway</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Canopy Commons</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lantern Market</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Riverside Promenade</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonflower Gardens</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hearthwood Residences</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Treetop Walk</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Artisan's Row</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Forest Bathhouse</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Glasshouse Conservatory</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Starlight Pavilion</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Old Grove Library</th><td data-label="Approach">Optional-world map</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Riverglass Café</th><td data-label="Approach">Riverside Promenade → Enter the café</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>When a place is missing or blocked</h2><ul><li>Check current Objectives and indoor actions. A room may have no separate district-map icon.</li><li>If the district is right but entry fails, check opening hours, schedules, construction, invitations and content access. High attributes do not replace unfinished route events.</li><li>Similar facility names can belong to different eras. Check era and district; compact map labels can also differ from indoor titles.</li><li>Use the character’s current schedule and Objectives to find them. This location list does not promise all-day NPC presence.</li><li>A recruitment cell must be built and vacant. Use the current construction menu to see which additional rooms you can build.</li><li>An optional world needs its separate installation, enabled state, restart and access. Base maps do not show uninstalled mod locations.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="getting-started.html">Getting Started</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-haunted-mansion.html">Haunted Mansion</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><div class="starter-lead"><p>先看菜单中的当前目标，再选时代与地区。地图上的建筑不等于建筑内的全部房间；有些入口要从室内行动、角色邀请、建设或活动任务开启。本页按正常可走的路线整理，展开目录前请留意后期地点名称。</p><ol><li>打开当前时代的地区地图，查看地点名称与营业时间。</li><li>进入建筑后，再看室内的前往／返回行动。</li><li>地点未出现时，先查目标、营业时间和入口所在的房间。</li></ol></div>
<section id="zh-travel"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Three_Eras"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Travel_&amp;_Access_Rules"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Travel_.26_Access_Rules"></span><h2>地图、时钟与时代移动</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">时代</th><th scope="col">常用锚点</th><th scope="col">地区</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">现代</th><td data-label="常用锚点">你的卧室（外观随起始专长变化）</td><td data-label="地区">上城区 / 市中心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪</th><td data-label="常用锚点">远古大地神殿（祭坛室）</td><td data-label="地区">村庄郊外 / 国王领地</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来</th><td data-label="常用锚点">Nova的量子研究实验室</td><td data-label="地区">边缘区 / 核心区</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>时代跳跃通常以60分钟为基础，相关升级会改变当前耗时。以确认入口及当前升级为准。</li><li>同一地区的普通地图移动通常不推进时钟；切换地区和室内行动另看各自耗时。现代跨区交通有自己的车票与通行升级。</li><li>未来的两个交通枢纽都出售「超环坐标」：一次300信用点、10分钟，开启地图地区切换并让交通按选定目的地行驶。</li><li>表中的营业结束时刻不包含在开放时间内，例如09:00–17:00在17:00关门。角色排班和课程时段还需另外满足；指定活动按自身提示处理。</li><li>「—」表示地点没有固定营业时段，并不保证所有角色或行动全天出现。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-quick-routes"><h2>常用目的地怎么找</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">要做的事</th><th scope="col">路线</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">恢复与日常学习</th><td data-label="路线">你的卧室（外观随起始专长变化）；城市健身房（上城区）；城市图书馆（上城区）；大学校园</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采矿</th><td data-label="路线">山脚 → <a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">采矿指南</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地下城探索</th><td data-label="路线"><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城入口、准备与返回</a>；<a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">无限地下城</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公会</th><td data-label="路线">战士公会；吟游诗人公会；后巷 → 盗贼公会</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">塔防基地</th><td data-label="路线">反抗军藏身处 → 作战中心 → <a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">塔防指南</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商店扩建</th><td data-label="路线">街角便利店 → 扩建委托完成后的商店与储藏室</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
